{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他暂时把回去放到一边，想起曾被当作自己人，心里短暂暖了一下，但没有回头；随后暖意退去，仍要独自面对难事。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"短暂温暖、温柔、不舍、心悬起\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间小字里的熟悉的沉思与祈求气息、像离开前回望一眼、胸口忽然吸进一口气、只是瞬间喘息等画面，需要逐句读。右侧三条小字也不容易一眼辨认。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起曾经被当作自己人，短暂感到温暖，但并不打算回去；回忆带来的暖意很快消退，现实中的难事仍要自己面对。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心暖、温柔不舍、短暂喘息、失落、不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间两行小字中的歌唱、沉思、祈求气息和呼吸变化，需要进一步阅读才能理解它们与人物处境的关系；右侧三条情绪提示也容易被忽略。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他没有选择回头，只是短暂想起曾被接纳的时刻，感到一阵暖意；但回忆无法替他解决眼前的难事，心重新悬了起来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"短暂温暖、怀念、温柔不舍、无着落\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间小字里的离开前回望、胸口吸气、瞬间喘息和没能安顿下来等具体画面，以及右侧关于离开后的空虚、思念与现实刺痛的提示。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两条大字号长句都在争夺主要注意力：上面讲暂时不回头和短暂心暖，下面讲暖意消退和现实难处。两者的先后关系能看出来，但一眼需要跨越两个较长的信息块才能完整抓住人物的变化。中间小字又连续放入歌唱、沉思、回望、呼吸等多个画面，右侧还有三条独立提示。这些内容总体能挂回人物的情绪变化，但部分画面和提示不容易一眼找到与主线的对应关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3c3a13b2-f239-4b64-8a46-629ba428a5fa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004325584834Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:44:17.029027+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "66321f7f32ee2f61f61ea1e9b9e8af8f5c9fcbc6e51d78dd66176460e6d66795", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004325584834Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "fcea491aa66545f1a75f6dc4969e0b141d12f6871c73b62f41b89fde91504551"}}}
